      "description": "Grab your wellies and join us for a splashing good time! During October half term, we're pond dipping with the Friends of Headstone Manor Park in The Yeading Brook to discover what amazing creatures live beneath the surface. This fun family event is part of our nature week celebrations – perfect for curious kids and nature-loving adults alike. Bring your wellies and your curiosity – we'll provide everything else. Perfect for families who love getting hands-on with nature!",
