      "dedupe_key": "turning-page-history-of-reading|2026-09-03|headstone-manor",
      "description": "Want to know how books have changed throughout history? As part of the National Year of Reading, in this mini-exhibition find hidden treasures from the archives and discover how children once enjoyed reading. Although small in size, this display highlights the enduring importance of books and celebrates the rich history of reading through just a few carefully chosen items from Harrow's collections. Sponsored by The Friends of the Museum – Headstone Manor and Museum.",
      "ends_at": "2027-01-03T00:00:00Z",
      "image_url": "https://harrow-arts.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/HMM/Whats-On-Autumn-26/Turning-the-Page.png?w=640&h=360&q=100&auto=format&fit=crop&dm=1784627269&s=ca267689a19944ee97c3a9e040e7dd82",
