      "dedupe_key": "harrow-now-then-memorabilia-session|2026-11-17|headstone-manor",
      "description": "Join Community Connex for a nostalgic drop-in session exploring how Harrow has changed since the 1960s. Bring your memories (or browse ours!) as we handle objects, photos, and stories from decades gone by. Taking place during UK Disability History Month, this session is a chance to reflect on the borough's shared history while celebrating inclusive, accessible community spaces for all. Free and open to all — hosted by Community Connex, a local charity supporting our community. A £4 donation is warmly welcomed to help continue their work but is not required. Community Connex is a Harrow-based community organisation (part of Harrow Mencap) dedicated to bringing people together through inclusive, engaging local activities and events.",
      "ends_at": null,
      "image_url": "https://harrow-arts.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/HMM/Whats-On-Autumn-26/community-connex-memory-session.JPG?w=640&h=360&q=100&auto=format&fit=crop&dm=1784632803&s=f2bd88fe11249b788cca31865ef17a9e",
